# MM3 faces for the states the library had none for (the reference's
# D123182666, GENERATED in the library's grid, landed 2026-10-03), and the
# timed faces (D123167028 / D123182666): a live run quiet for 3 minutes is
# thinking (eyes up, three dots); a paused row sleeps (a z rising); a frozen
# row is confused; an idle row untouched for a day is tired, still. A live
# run with news under 3 minutes old keeps its blink.
#
# settings: {"window_width":1100,"window_height":760,"open_tabs":[],"active_tab":"","theme":"dark","icon_set":"mm3"}

wait_frames 20
set_session_state t5 running 200
set_session_state t3 running 30
set_session_state t6 paused
set_session_state t8 frozen
set_session_state t1 idle 90000
wait_frames 10
expect_row_mm3 t5 thinking neutral
expect_row_mm3 t3 blink blink
expect_row_mm3 t6 sleeping sleeping
expect_row_mm3 t8 confused confused
expect_row_mm3 t1 still tired
